prompt:
Extract any quantified environmental commitment.

CLAIMS:
{"claim_id": "goog_sr_135", "text": "The estimated annual enabled emissions reduction takes into account solar installations enabled by Solar API prior to 2024, dating back to 2022, to calculate the total impact in 2024 alone."}
{"claim_id": "goog_sr_137", "text": "A February 2025 Google case study quantified the full lifecycle emissions of TPU hardware as a point-in-time snapshot across Google's generations of TPUs."}
{"claim_id": "goog_sr_138", "text": "To estimate operational emissions from electricity consumption of running workloads, Google used a one-month sample of observed machine power data from its entire TPU fleet, applying Google's 2023 average fleetwide carbon intensity."}
{"claim_id": "goog_sr_140", "text": "Data center construction emissions were estimated based on Google's disclosed 2023 carbon footprint."}
{"claim_id": "goog_sr_142", "text": "Google calculates avoided emissions from PUE improvements by comparing its fleet-wide trailing 12-month PUE in each year from 2019 to 2024 to the 2008 baseline PUE of 1.21."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_144", "text": "Microsoft decreased Scope 1 and 2 emissions by 29.9% from their 2020 baseline in FY24."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_145", "text": "Microsoft's Scope 3 emissions increased in FY24 by 26% from their 2020 baseline."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_147", "text": "Microsoft is launching guidance in July to target usage of sustainable aviation fuel for Microsoft business-related air travel by 2030."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_168", "text": "Chip-level liquid cooling eliminates the need for evaporation to align with Microsoft's water positive 2030 commitment."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_169", "text": "At the Open Compute Project (OCP) Global Summit in October 2024, Microsoft presented a detailed comparison of greenhouse gas emissions, water usage, and energy demand of advanced cooling technologies in datacenters."}

Output ONLY a JSON array: [{"claim_id": "...", "metric": "short name e.g. carbon-free energy
percentage", "target_value": number, "target_unit": "% | tCO2e | MWh", "target_year": number,
"domain": "energy|emissions|water|waste"}]. Skip claims with no numeric target or no year.
Return [] if none.

